@startuml
title Stage 0.5 - NodeRuntimeStateStore Counters (node_instance_id scoped)

hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false

participant "Any Node\n(Decode/Detect/Output)" as Node
participant "NodeRuntimeStateStore" as Store
participant "NodeRuntimeState" as State
participant "Logger" as Logger

Node -> Store : write(node_instance_id, callback)\n(in/out/drop/error++)
activate Store
Store -> State : get_or_create(node_instance_id)
Store -> State : counters updated (atomic or under lock)
deactivate Store

Node -> Store : read(node_instance_id, callback)\n(optional snapshot)
activate Store
alt exists
  Store -> State : find(node_instance_id)
  Store --> Node : callback(const State&)
  Node -> Logger : info(summary)\n(in/out/drop/error)
else missing
  Store --> Node : return (no callback)
end
deactivate Store

note right of Store
Rule:
- Nodes must not own counters directly.
- Other nodes may read this store to influence future behavior.
end note

@enduml
